"In this page, the Home Assistant blocks use a <b>sample house</b>, so you can build and test safely. Change a state below (press Enter) to try your 'when … changes' scripts. Exported Python connects to your real Home Assistant: set HA_URL and HA_TOKEN (a long-lived access token from your Home Assistant profile, under Security).":"Forsin duillén-so, úsáitit clocha Home Assistant <b>tech samla</b>, co ndernais ⁊ co fromais cen gúasacht. Claechlaig staid thís (brúid Enter) do fromad do scríbend 'in tan chlaechlaigthir …'. Cengailid in Python tucad ass frit Home Assistant fír: suidig HA_URL ⁊ HA_TOKEN (comartha rochtana fota-beo ó phróifíl Home Assistant, fo Security).",
