"Save as GitHub Actions (.zip)":"Taisc mar GitHub Actions (.zip)",
"it has no 'when it's' or 'every' script, so there's nothing to run on a schedule":"ní fil scríbend 'in tan as' nó 'cach' aice, co ná fil ní do rith fo amserad",
"it waits for things to happen, like messages, web requests or changes, and GitHub Actions only runs it at set times":"anaid fri nithib do thecmung, amal aithesca, iarratais lín nó claechlóid, ⁊ ní reith GitHub Actions é acht i n-amseraib suidigthib",
"it uses Llama, MCP servers or folders on your own computer, which GitHub can't reach":"úsáitid Llama, frithálaid MCP nó comrair fort rímaire féin, nád cumaing do GitHub do ruchtain",
"it asks you questions while it runs, and nobody is there to answer":"imchomairc ceista dít céin reithes, ⁊ ní fil nech and do frecra",
"This program can't run on GitHub Actions: {why}.":"Ní cumaing don ordugud-so rith for GitHub Actions: {why}.",
"Saved {name}-actions.zip. Put its files in a private GitHub repository and add the secrets SETUP.md lists; then it runs on schedule.":"Ro-taisced {name}-actions.zip. Cuir a lebráin i stór díamair GitHub ⁊ tormaig na rúna liostaiges SETUP.md; iarsin reithid fo amserad.",
