"This copy of Second Thought can build programs, try them on sample data, explain them and export them, but it can't run them with Claude. For that, open it in claude.ai:":"As-tá don athscríbund-so de Second Thought ordaigthi do chumtach, a fromad for fius samla, a mínigud ⁊ a tabairt ass, acht ní cumaing dó a rith la Claude. Do sin, oslaic i claude.ai é:",
"Use your own API key":"Úsáit h'eochair API féin",
