"Remember on this browser":"Cuimnig isin brabsálaid-se",
"Use this key":"Úsáit in eochair-se",
"Cancel":"Scuir de",
"Or use your own API key, from the bar at the top.":"Nó úsáit h'eochair API féin, ón barra tuas.",
"That doesn't look like an Anthropic API key. They start with sk-ant-.":"Ní cosmail sin fri eochair API Anthropic. Tinscnait co sk-ant-.",
"This browser won't keep the key. Allow site data for this page, then try again.":"Ní choimétfa in brabsálaid-se in eochair. Ceadaig fios láthraig don duillén-so, ⁊ fromaid doridisi.",
"The key goes only from this browser to api.anthropic.com, and runs are charged to its account. It's kept until you close this tab, unless you tick Remember. It's never saved in programs, exports or the run log. Make one at console.anthropic.com.":"Ní téit in eochair acht ón brabsálaid-se co api.anthropic.com, ⁊ cuirther lóg na rith fora cuntas. Coimétthar co ndúntais in cluaisín-se, mani comarthaigi Cuimnig. Ní taiscthir itir i n-ordaigthib, i tabartaib ass nó isin lebor riuth. Déna óen ag console.anthropic.com.",
"Claude's API said: {problem}":"As-bert API Claude: {problem}",
"Kraken":"Kraken",
"Kraken's tools can't be reached from this page, so the agent works without them here. Export to Python, with kraken-cli installed, to use them.":"Ní fétar glésa Kraken do ruchtain ón duillén-so, co ndénann in gnímaid opair cenaib sund. Tabair ass co Python, co kraken-cli suidigthe, dia n-úsáit.",
"read your Kraken balances and orders, market prices, and trade on paper":"légad do fuidlech ⁊ t'ordaigthe Kraken, lóga margaid, ⁊ creicc for pápar",
"trade on your Kraken account with real money (asking you before every order)":"creicc for do chuntas Kraken co n-airgiut fír (oc imchomarc dít ria cach ordugud)",
"You can build programs with the keyboard alone. Press <b>Tab</b> until you reach the block editor, then:":"As-tá dait ordaigthi do chumtach cosin mérchlár nammá. Brúid <b>Tab</b> co rísai in cerdcha cloch, ⁊ iarsin:",
"<b>T</b> opens the blocks: the <b>up</b> and <b>down</b> arrows choose a category, <b>right</b> opens it, <b>up</b> and <b>down</b> choose a block, and <b>Enter</b> adds it. Move it into place with the arrow keys, then press <b>Enter</b> again.":"Oslaicid <b>T</b> na clocha: togait na saigte <b>suas</b> ⁊ <b>sís</b> rann, oslaicid <b>dess</b> í, togait <b>suas</b> ⁊ <b>sís</b> cloich, ⁊ tormaigid <b>Enter</b> í. Gluais ina hinad cosna saigtib í, ⁊ brúid <b>Enter</b> doridisi.",
"In your program, the arrow keys move between blocks, their slots and their fields. <b>Enter</b> on a field lets you type in it or choose, and <b>W</b> brings you back to your program.":"It ordugud, gluaisit na saigte eter clocha, a sloit ⁊ a ngoirt. Léicid <b>Enter</b> for gort duit scríbend ann nó rogu, ⁊ dobeir <b>W</b> ar ais thú dot ordugud.",
"<b>M</b> moves the block you're on (the arrow keys, then <b>Enter</b>, or <b>Esc</b> to stop), <b>X</b> takes it off what it's joined to, <b>D</b> makes a copy, and <b>Delete</b> removes it.":"Gluaisid <b>M</b> in cloich fora mbí (na saigte, iarsin <b>Enter</b>, nó <b>Esc</b> do scur), benaid <b>X</b> ón ní fris mbí ceangailte í, dogní <b>D</b> athscríbend, ⁊ scrísaid <b>Delete</b> í.",
"<b>N</b> and <b>B</b> go to the next and previous script, <b>I</b> says where you are, and <b>Ctrl+Enter</b> opens a block's menu. <b>Ctrl+C</b>, <b>Ctrl+X</b>, <b>Ctrl+V</b> and <b>Ctrl+Z</b> copy, cut, paste and undo.":"Téit <b>N</b> ⁊ <b>B</b> don scríbund ala ⁊ remi, as-beir <b>I</b> cá mbí, ⁊ oslaicid <b>Ctrl+Enter</b> rogu cloiche. Athscríbait, gerrait, greimmaigit ⁊ dílgit <b>Ctrl+C</b>, <b>Ctrl+X</b>, <b>Ctrl+V</b> ⁊ <b>Ctrl+Z</b>.",
"A screen reader reads out each block, field and category as you reach it, and <b>Alt+Shift+A</b> adds sound cues as you go in and out of blocks. Everywhere else, <b>Tab</b> moves between buttons. When a program asks you something, the answer box gets the focus, and <b>Ctrl+Enter</b> sends a typed answer.":"Léigid léitheoir scáith cach cloich, gort ⁊ rann in tan ro-saigi, ⁊ tormaigid <b>Alt+Shift+A</b> comarthai fogair oc dul isteach ⁊ amach a clochaib. In cach inad aile, gluaisid <b>Tab</b> eter cnaipe. In tan imchomairces ordugud ní dít, gaibid bosca na frecra in fócas, ⁊ foídid <b>Ctrl+Enter</b> frecra scríbtha.",
