"This step uses Claude, which this page can't reach: open it in claude.ai, add your Anthropic key from the bar at the top, or choose a model you have a key for.":"Úsáitid in chéim-se Claude, nád cumaing don duillén-so do ruchtain: oslaic i claude.ai é, tormaig h'eochair Anthropic ón barra tuas, nó tog delb atá eochair lat di.",
